  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "The scientific method is used for experiments you do in the classroom.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-01.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "For example, you blow up a balloon to see how its size changes or use a candle to explore how different materials burn.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-02.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Scientists all over the world use their background knowledge to do experiments too.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-03.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "It is a way to avoid drawing conclusions that aren't correct.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-04.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "There are usually four steps in the scientific method including observation, hypothesis, experiment and conclusion.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-05.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "These may not always be completed in the same order but the first step is usually to ask a question about your observation.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-06.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "You might organise your notes on a desk to make sure that the central idea remains focused.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-07.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "The second step is to state a possible answer to the question.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-08.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "A good hypothesis includes three things.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-09.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "The explanation for the observations.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-10.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "text": "It is able to be tested and it will usually predict new outcomes.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-11.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "text": "The third step is the experiment.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-12.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "text": "A test which will either challenge or support your guess.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-13.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "text": "The hypothesis will then be proved true or false.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-14.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "text": "The final step is to think about what happened.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-15.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "text": "If the results support the hypothesis, a conclusion can be written, and you can share it with the rest of the world, probably by publishing it on a website.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-16.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "text": "This allows anybody interested in the field to learn from your work.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-17.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "text": "Then they could conduct their own research anywhere in the world.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-18.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "text": "So don't forget to check your grammar to present your findings clearly.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-19.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "text": "If the hypothesis is not supported, you may write a new hypothesis based on the results.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-20.mp3",
      "exists": true
    }
  ],
